<title>ANTIGUA: CRICKET-WEST INDIES 56-1 AT CLOSE AGAINST SRI LANKA (223).</title>
<headline>CRICKET-WEST INDIES 56-1 AT CLOSE AGAINST SRI LANKA (223).</headline>
<dateline>ST JOHN'S, Antigua 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>West Indies,  replying to Sri Lanka's first innings total of 223, were 56 for one at the close on the opening day of the first test on Friday.</p>
<p>Scores:  Sri Lanka 223 (S. Jayasuriya 85, C. Ambrose 5-37). West Indies 56-1.</p>
</text>
